2020-11-28T10:46:04Z","updated_at":"2020-11-29T22:39:53Z","closed_at":"2020-11-29T19:42:02Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Hello and happy Thanksgiving. 🦃 \r\n\r\n`gofumpt` recently implemented the feature of leaving along the following code:\r\n\r\n```\r\nif longCondition1 &&\r\n\tlongCondition2 &&\r\n\tlongCondition3 &&\r\n\tlongCondition4 &&\r\n\tlongCondition5 {\r\n\r\n\treturn 123\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nHowever, it seems that `gofumpt` will still mess up code with comments.\r\nFor example, the following code:\r\n\r\n```\r\nif longCondition1 &&\r\n\tlongCondition2 &&\r\n\tlongCondition3 &&\r\n\tlongCondition4 &&\r\n\tlongCondition5 {\r\n\r\n\t// We specifically want to return 123 here because of quantum fluctuations\r\n\treturn 123\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nWill be transformed into:\r\n\r\n```\r\nif longCondition1 &&\r\n\tlongCondition2 &&\r\n\tlongCondition3 &&\r\n\tlongCondition4 &&\r\n\tlongCondition5 {\r\n\t// We specifically want to return 123 here because of quantum fluctuations\r\n\treturn 123\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis is undesired for the same reason as [the original issue](https://github.com/mvdan/gofumpt/issues/88).\r\nIs this a bug?","closed_by":{"login":"Zamiell","id":5511220,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTEyMjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5511220?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zamiell","html_url":"https://github.com/Zamiell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zamiell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zamiell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zamiell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zamiell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zamiell/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.g